{"type":"message","id":"f1dd4c12","parentId":"a7579e2e","timestamp":"2026-08-02T03:04:04.470Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Docker Desktop 无法启动，MCP 服务不可用。脚本依赖小红书 MCP 来获取内容，但 Docker 挂了，无法获取内容。\n\nI need to report this failure - Docker Desktop 无法启动，导致 xiaohongshu-mcp 容器无法运行，脚本无法获取小红书内容，无法推送。"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n⚠️ **小红书推送失败**\n\n**原因：** Docker Desktop 无法启动，`xiaohongshu-mcp` 容器无法运行，导致脚本无法连接小红书 MCP 服务（localhost:18060 连接超时）。\n\n**错误详情：**\n```\nrequests.exceptions.ReadTimeout: HTTPConnectionPool(host='localhost', port=18060): Read timed out\ndocker start xiaohongshu-mcp → Docker Desktop is unable to start\n```\n\n**需要：**\n1. 启动 Docker Desktop（或检查为什么它启动失败）\n2. Docker 恢复后，执行 `docker start xiaohongshu-mcp` 启动小红书 MCP\n3. 重新触发推送任务\n\n如需我稍后重试，请先确认 Docker Desktop 已就绪。\n</final>"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1785639838370}}
